meta {
  name: 993 [DRAFT-V4E] [LOCAL / TEST ONLY] Parent submits feedback on owned lesson
  type: http
  seq: 993
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/lesson-library/v1/me/lessons/{{phase_de_e6_lesson_id}}/feedback
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{bearerToken}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Request-ID: {{request_id}}
  Content-Type: application/json
  Idempotency-Key: {{phase_de_e6_feedback_key}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "feedback_text": "Synthetic test feedback on pacing and visuals."
  }
}

script:pre-request {
  bru.setVar("phase_de_e6_feedback_key", "e6-feedback-" + Date.now());
}

script:post-response {
  const body = res.getBody();
  if (body && typeof body.feedback_id === "string") {
    bru.setVar("phase_de_e6_feedback_id", body.feedback_id);
  }
}

tests {
  test("assert feedback submission contract", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(201);
    expect(res.getHeader("X-Request-ID")).to.equal(bru.getVar("request_id"));
    expect(res.getHeader("Cache-Control")).to.equal("private, no-store");
    const body = res.getBody();
    expect(body.contract).to.equal("ParentLessonFeedbackV1");
    expect(body.lesson_id).to.equal(bru.getVar("phase_de_e6_lesson_id"));
  });
}

docs {
  DRAFT after Phase D/E: checked against committed Phase E code at 98aa9837 (PHASE_E_FINAL_ROUTE_LIST_20261125.md / 784134fc); not yet run against a live backend.
  Role: Owning Parent - set bearerToken to seed-parent-p1 token
  Needs: needs-fixture: owned Parent lesson phase_de_e6_lesson_id; saves phase_de_e6_feedback_key, phase_de_e6_feedback_id
  Expected: 201 / ParentLessonFeedbackV1 (Cache-Control: private, no-store; note: lesson_feedback.py at 98aa9837 does not set Vary: Authorization)
  Source: backend/src/sketch2life/interfaces/http/routers/lesson_feedback.py, backend/src/sketch2life/infrastructure/lesson_library/feedback.py
  The accessible-lesson check accepts a current public or shared lesson visible through the Parent subject/account alias.
}
